{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/5odhjhcoat430matzdtt4vjn2fglzjm.mp3","text":"......完成了。作战计划，报告书，任务安排都已经分好类别......啊，这样分不对吗？抱歉，我还不太熟悉这个......","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/6hl8hztt4o7fj640uvqwrp0vkvqziuk.mp3","text":"艾沃娜和灰毫，有时会很吵闹，会害我听不清风声。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/in9kcg2tpi4vn636h36lbqn3dasopk8.mp3","text":"唔？训练场里的那个人是......耀骑士？......博士，我也可以过去那边看看吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/2cnn4gcw1kud7ywd1stwirhumjwixde.mp3","text":"......很像。坐在这里向外看，远处田里的作物成熟，人们正在收获的景象，和我的家乡很像。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/0ink4ufgx21eahypyuw1ksgyvvzkp53.mp3","text":"健康的人想在卡西米尔成为骑士很简单，只要去竞技场注册就可以。但想要成为真正的“骑士”，不管你是什么人，都会很难。非常难。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/4er915lnfby6mmyn71dbxz05hpnv2lr.mp3","text":"我赞同索娜的想法，也愿意为此而战斗......不过，实际上，或许我只是不想失去仅有的容身之所。博士，对你来说，罗德岛也是这样不惜一切也要捍卫的地方吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/an2dvcs9p1vbgukzujyxy23zkxuuoh9.mp3","text":"......治疗的谢礼。这是索娜，艾沃娜，还有灰毫拜托我带来的。还有，这一个是我选的。只是一点心意而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/q8x926rembwg61lhk2z8pgbhlyrwk5r.mp3","text":"曾经，我非常憧憬成为骑士。但就在去大骑士领的路上，一次意外让我成了感染者。就算是现在，我也还记得当时的感觉，从手掌，一直麻木到指尖......第一次，我握不住剑。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ktg33dwdlz8rku7vh2x93msjk42mckd.mp3","text":"......口笛，要听吗？以前在家乡，空闲的时候会吹。那个时候的风和现在不同，还很干净，不会有危险......让人安心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/gjl6ugvoq7pcr7pjyvjgsr2eb4jja4q.mp3","text":"你醒了？给，整理好的文件......这次没有出错了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/h146qnn6c33jzmmcohdw8tz6zs3o8fd.mp3","text":"红松骑士团所属骑士，“远牙”查丝汀娜，叫我远牙就好。我听过关于罗德岛，还有你的事，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/k5r0yoav4w8z83sm5yopude8dxe4vin.mp3","text":"......要输了。如果不回防，对手接不下这样一招。对面会输。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/4v1mvnpzwat1fxzewcrziy5vtsecmbv.mp3","text":"晋升？是和晋级差不多的意思吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/5eazbu6alzzzjrgnb75pdu0g7toeu5z.mp3","text":"我要的不多，我有的不多。所以......只要我还站在这，不管是谁，都别想再从我手里抢走任何东西！","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/ne2qyurelwlvx3ghgeecf69wk0chbl7.mp3","text":"......听你的。你是指挥官，我会听你的吩咐行动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/tdwc882plediqbys2in2l0v3bldgxzd.mp3","text":"团体战吗？明白了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/gdjg208v9tlg7blh1hbzlnf0hcowoxn.mp3","text":"整装。列队。......出发！","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/twd7maaaqav8ue5wts32hcr4e7qv3zy.mp3","text":"等等，风的流向变了......提高警惕！","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/ncgzfzbx8que8k25j5wt3kdtz4gazx0.mp3","text":"嗯。随时能上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/k9xhr4n0zt87kgpvnc0vjjc6g888d53.mp3","text":"一对一，还是一对多？","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/eeernlux7o7avnn89i1mol4aw3obvd5.mp3","text":"希望我们能堂堂正正决出胜负。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/mir5fl3275h240gqijqwimix1hh7ci0.mp3","text":"“远牙”查丝汀娜，由我来做你们的对手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/trcpzosk9gt5qj55nh9mbio0b6mxv8r.mp3","text":"风在鼓噪。我能听得出。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/oimohmvy6jub3gab1fc80pufm7ebqxw.mp3","text":"瞄准你了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/ng550pgkvag10gqlqeyaaot3vu8bjmv.mp3","text":"战斗中，无须多言。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/gi9wbadpngw9a2qqx1s175hdchpap85.mp3","text":"......到此为止。你们赢不了我，停手吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/5ze8ytwjfw5yxec8onwwlkqnhc35km5.mp3","text":"做得不错，博士。这是一场荣誉的胜利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/b0b75jnnjlktwt429t262j7q9zbsd0w.mp3","text":"幸不辱命，全部解决了。......太严肃了？是吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/2rx4wmsn6016dwk1dcjuwb4m1qu5dir.mp3","text":"我不对那些离开赛场的人动手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/1zjytlqb1opzysqzgtc6bg49lgpmnnn.mp3","text":"......先走！这里我来应对，博士，带着其他人先离开！","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/j44e05quf8kj6479ff86iddd3i45bfp.mp3","text":"不坏。流动的空气感觉很干净......谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/5t30z7jyzfjldnxorn4gmu1k859c28x.mp3","text":"嗯？什么，要签名吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/fil77lno6oju6e1dnsr3bwwwg9ks9qq.mp3","text":"博士？......嗯，不用听脚步声我也能认得出。风的感觉和别人不同。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/dwz9stykwmo6p8joftwmgpuci4x45gr.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/9aorgsb8kawxhe2b50w1ui5wp5kyvd9.mp3","text":"这里的风声中夹杂着很多杂音。烟花声、杯盘碰撞声和人们庆贺的声音，之前在家乡，每当过节，我的邻居们也是这样吵闹，不过我并不讨厌。新年快乐，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/3lp5k3j8uusmb84f4u3bfa8683eniyf.mp3","text":"......别动。头发翘起来了，嗯，先别动，我来帮你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_430_fartth/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/tqfmpl2oviqitvbhpuf2bvmh4ahhc5d.mp3","text":"......完成了。作战计划，报告书，任务安排都已经分好类别......啊，这样分不对吗？抱歉，我还不太熟悉这个......","alt":"voice/char_430_fartth/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/056j0r337alqbsybduq7f0a9687jh9k.mp3","text":"艾沃娜和灰毫，有时会很吵闹，会害我听不清风声。","alt":"voice/char_430_fartth/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/5roxme1secqsy0xrq6wgr68qj6egnto.mp3","text":"唔？训练场里的那个人是......耀骑士？......博士，我也可以过去那边看看吗？","alt":"voice/char_430_fartth/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/9xv7imvgxv3e3ippirw33pxppl0i4xj.mp3","text":"......很像。坐在这里向外看，远处田里的作物成熟，人们正在收获的景象，和我的家乡很像。","alt":"voice/char_430_fartth/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/5vrd0qdurcp7e0snnov0mj625phl23y.mp3","text"